{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017LMDjM4Sf1JGju9WMjRKZM","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-chart","number":3300,"kind":"pr","title":"(fix) Floor medication order encounter datetime to visit start","state":"merged","author":"denniskigen","createdAt":"2026-05-12T09:00:05.000Z","mergedAt":"2026-05-12T17:23:01.000Z","closedAt":"2026-05-12T17:23:01.000Z","url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-chart/pull/3300","mergeCommit":"33ae989b8a29fcee7e7fe8bba7ef153a4d583b12","syncedAt":"2026-10-23T19:00:04.598Z","tickets":[{"key":"O3-4444","source":"ticket-pattern"}],"commits":[{"sha":"33ae989b8a29fcee7e7fe8bba7ef153a4d583b12","source":"merge-commit-sha","verified":true}],"files":[{"path":"packages/esm-patient-common-lib/src/orders/postOrders.ts","additions":40,"deletions":5},{"path":"packages/esm-patient-medications-app/src/add-drug-order/drug-order-form.component.tsx","additions":5,"deletions":1},{"path":"packages/esm-patient-orders-app/src/order-basket/order-basket.component.tsx","additions":1,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/esm-patient-orders-app/src/order-basket/order-basket.utils.ts","additions":3,"deletions":0}],"body":"## Requirements\r\n\r\n- [x] This PR has a title that briefly describes the work done including the ticket number. If there is a ticket, make sure your PR title includes a [conventional commit](https://o3-docs.openmrs.org/docs/frontend-modules/contributing.en-US#contributing-guidelines) label. See existing PR titles for inspiration.\r\n- [x] My work is based on designs, which are linked or shown either in the Jira ticket or the description below. (See also: [Styleguide](http://om.rs/o3ui))\r\n- [x] My work includes tests or is validated by existing tests.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nSubmitting a medication order fails with `Encounter.datetimeShouldBeInVisitDatesRange` when the user-selected start date falls before the visit's start datetime:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"code\": \"webservices.rest.error.invalid.submission\",\r\n  \"fieldErrors\": {\r\n    \"encounterDatetime\": [{\r\n      \"code\": \"Encounter.datetimeShouldBeInVisitDatesRange\",\r\n      \"message\": \"The encounter datetime should be between the visit start and stop dates.\"\r\n    }]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n#3198 introduced backdating of `encounterDatetime` to the earliest basket `startDate` so the backend's `dateActivated >= encounterDatetime` constraint holds. That fix overlooks a second backend constraint: `Encounter.datetimeShouldBeInVisitDatesRange`. The PR description called this out as a deferred follow-up (\"Datetime precision on date-picker floors\") with the suggested fix being a \"clamp-on-submit (or a schema check against `getStartDateMinimum`).\" This PR implements that follow-up.\r\n\r\nBackend constraints satisfied (verified against `EncounterValidator.java` and `OrderValidator.java` in `openmrs-core`):\r\n\r\n1. `encounterDatetime` must be within `[visit.startDatetime, visit.stopDatetime]` (strict `before`/`after`, so equal-to-boundary is OK).\r\n2. Each order's `dateActivated >= encounterDatetime` (strict `after`).\r\n3. For `REVISE`, the new `dateActivated` must be strictly after the previous order's `dateActivated` because the backend computes `previous.dateStopped = new.dateActivated - 1s`.\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n\r\n- **`postOrdersOnNewEncounter`** (`postOrders.ts`) clamps the encounter date to the visit window — floor to `visit.startDatetime`, ceiling at `visit.stopDatetime` — owning the encounter-bounds rule in one place.\r\n- **`getOrdersPayloadFromOrderBasket`** (`postOrders.ts`) floors each basket item's `startDate` to the encounter date before invoking the prep function, so each order's `dateActivated` stays `>= encounterDatetime` after the encounter is clamped. New `floorOrderStartDate` helper.\r\n- **Drug order form** (`drug-order-form.component.tsx`) snaps `data.startDate` up to `startDateMin` in `handleFormSubmission` when it falls below. The picker is date-only and resolves selections to local 00:00, while `startDateMin` is at datetime precision (visit start for NEW/RENEW, `previous.dateActivated + 1s` for REVISE). The snap covers the time-of-day component the picker cannot represent.\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n## Related Issue\r\n\r\nFollow-up to #3198 (originally tracked as [O3-4444](https://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-4444)).\r\n\r\n## Other\r\n\r\n`orderEncounterType` config-schema duplication between `esm-patient-medications-app` and `esm-patient-orders-app` and the visit-disabled-install backdating path remain as the deferred items from #3198.\r\n\r\n[Order entry in O3: A PM Reference](https://openmrs.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/docs/pages/1031766039/Order+Entry+in+O3+A+PM+Reference)\n\n[O3-4444]: https://openmrs.atlassian.net/browse/O3-4444?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","nextOffset":null,"truncated":["commentBodies was cut when the pull request was imported"]}"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd4eb1b2-0825-40d3-b56b-bf6bfea9be98","uuid":"97b88c3e-0383-43d2-a100-c62dd9d7ff43","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:12:35.385Z","tool_use_result":[{"type":"text","text":"{"repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-chart","number":3300,"kind":"pr","title":"(fix) Floor medication order encounter datetime to visit start","state":"merged","author":"denniskigen","createdAt":"2026-05-12T09:00:05.000Z","mergedAt":"2026-05-12T17:23:01.000Z","closedAt":"2026-05-12T17:23:01.000Z","url":"https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-patient-chart/pull/3300","mergeCommit":"33ae989b8a29fcee7e7fe8bba7ef153a4d583b12","syncedAt":"2026-10-23T19:00:04.598Z","tickets":[{"key":"O3-4444","source":"ticket-pattern"}],"commits":[{"sha":"33ae989b8a29fcee7e7fe8bba7ef153a4d583b12","source":"merge-commit-sha","verified":true}],"files":[{"path":"packages/esm-patient-common-lib/src/orders/postOrders.ts","additions":40,"dele